rmc-armor-plate-coagulator-attached = You feel tickling as you activate {THE($plate)}.
rmc-armor-plate-coagulator-detached = You feel {THE($plate)} peeling off from your skin.

rmc-armor-plate-translator-attached = {CAPITALIZE(THE($plate))} buzzes as it begins to listen for input.
rmc-armor-plate-translator-detached = {CAPITALIZE(THE($plate))} makes a sad woop sound as it powers down.
rmc-armor-plate-translator-unequipped = {CAPITALIZE(THE($plate))} makes a woop sound as it is powered down.

rmc-armor-plate-break = You feel {THE($plate)} break apart.

rmc-armor-plate-anti-decay-death = {CAPITALIZE(THE($plate))} detects your death and starts injecting various chemicals to slow down your final demise!
rmc-armor-plate-anti-decay-revive = {CAPITALIZE(THE($plate))} beeps: Registering user life signs, halting preservation efforts.

rmc-armor-plate-injector-empty = {CAPITALIZE(THE($plate))}'s inner reserve is empty, replace the plate!
rmc-armor-plate-injector-refuse = You hold the two buttons, but the plate buzzes and refuses to inject, indicating the potential overdose!
rmc-armor-plate-injector-overdose = You hold the two buttons, and the plate injects the chemicals, but makes a worrying beep, indicating overdose!
rmc-armor-plate-injector-adjusted = You hold the two buttons, and the plate injects the chemicals, but makes a relieving beep, indicating it adjusted amounts it injected to prevent overdose!
rmc-armor-plate-injector-mode-off = You toggle overdose protection to OVERRIDE. Overdose protection is now offline.
rmc-armor-plate-injector-mode-dynamic = You toggle overdose protection to DYNAMIC. Overdose subsystems will inject chemicals but will not go above overdose levels.
rmc-armor-plate-injector-mode-strict = You toggle overdose protection to STRICT. Overdose subsystems will refuse to inject if any of chemicals will overdose.

rmc-armor-plate-recycle-invalid = You cannot recycle this type of plate.

rmc-biomass-analyzer-interrupted = You were interrupted!
